TITLE 1D transport: Na/Ca exchange; report a(Na+) in cell 3 at shift 10
SOLUTION 0  Infilling
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate with solution 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -head shift cell a_Na
10 PUNCH SIM_NO, CELL_NO, ACT("Na+")

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -punch_cells 3
    -punch_frequency 1
END
